### Component 2: Department Selection API

#### [NEW] [src/app/api/session/select-department/route.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/app/api/session/select-department/route.ts)

New API endpoint called after login (or from a department switcher). It:
1. Validates the user is authorized for the requested department (checks `user_departments`)
2. Updates `auth.users.app_metadata.department_id` to the selected department UUID
3. Refreshes the session so the new JWT contains the updated `department_id` claim

```
POST /api/session/select-department
Body: { "departmentId": "uuid" }
```

This is the **key mechanism**: by updating `app_metadata.department_id` at session time, all existing RLS policies (`get_my_department_id()`) continue to work without modification.

