### Component 3: Department Selector UI

#### [NEW] [src/components/auth/department-selector.tsx](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/components/auth/department-selector.tsx)

A modal/page shown after login when a user has multiple department assignments. Displays a list of their authorized departments and lets them pick one for this session.

- Fetches from `user_departments` joined with `departments` to show department names
- Calls the `/api/session/select-department` endpoint on selection
- Redirects to `/dashboard` on success
- If user has only one department, auto-selects and skips the UI

#### [MODIFY] [src/app/auth/callback/route.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/app/auth/callback/route.ts)

After SSO callback completes, check if user has multiple departments. If yes, redirect to `/auth/select-department` instead of directly to `/dashboard`.

#### [NEW] [src/app/auth/select-department/page.tsx](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/app/auth/select-department/page.tsx)

Page wrapper that renders the `DepartmentSelector` component.

