> **Zero RLS Changes Required**: Because this design updates `app_metadata.department_id` dynamically at session time, the existing `get_my_department_id()` RLS helper function and **all 8+ RLS policies** that use it continue to work unchanged. This is the key architectural advantage of Option 2.

