## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1: Should the department switcher require re-authentication (MFA challenge)?**
> Switching departments mid-session could be considered a privilege change. Should we require a TOTP re-challenge when switching, or is it acceptable to switch freely within the same session?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2: Audit trail for department switches?**
> Should every department switch be logged to `local_audit_reads` or `audit_logs` for compliance? (Recommended: Yes — log who switched to which department and when.)

